  out children aren't testing twice weekly  so some cases may be being missed the  Prime Minister has said we're not out of  the woods yet and cases could rise again  as a lifting of lockdown starts to  filter through to the data possibly  later this week but let's hope the  numbers keep pointing the right way
 

